{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":11973,\"title\":\"Thirteen Days\",\"tagline\":\"You'll never believe how close we came.\",\"overview\":\"The story of the Cuban Missile Crisis in 1962—the nuclear standoff with the USSR sparked by the discovery by the Americans of missile bases established on the Soviet-allied island of Cuba.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aLx9UXH9fK2v6NDMvMyW4X88K3u.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pR3v192B20nFtsHY1jZQS4AkN0a.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":884,\"year\":2000,\"runtime\":145,\"genres\":[\"History\",\"Thriller\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":80000000,\"revenue\":34566746,\"director\":\"Roger Donaldson\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":21370,\"name\":\"Roger Donaldson\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qh19qXD1JpFSNhRKtg2vm9nDTwY.jpg\"},{\"id\":1269,\"name\":\"Kevin Costner\",\"character\":\"Kenneth O'Donnell\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bykmxJHLfbFM3NT05RZXhx8YTzF.jpg\"},{\"id\":21089,\"name\":\"Bruce Greenwood\",\"character\":\"John F. Kennedy\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AmfylDaijUHq8cHMq002xfkW7Vk.jpg\"},{\"id\":63544,\"name\":\"Steven Culp\",\"character\":\"Robert F. Kennedy\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oTD15Qg74sPV2Sj082pNMJ54Y0b.jpg\"},{\"id\":19152,\"name\":\"Dylan Baker\",\"character\":\"Robert McNamara\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4mw6xj8Aj3ixjjeUj9pZdZPTbvz.jpg\"},{\"id\":84707,\"name\":\"Michael Fairman\",\"character\":\"Adlai Stevenson\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zFLOZiKJJxhSTwgKgAGZyexOyUm.jpg\"},{\"id\":131120,\"name\":\"Henry Strozier\",\"character\":\"Dean Rusk\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o8qSiiuqUKIxC7lRKeNe3Jk3ipv.jpg\"},{\"id\":52021,\"name\":\"Frank Wood\",\"character\":\"McGeorge Bundy\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/er5hLYMwjAYb3saRQcNZED4rtgx.jpg\"},{\"id\":27116,\"name\":\"Kevin Conway\",\"character\":\"Gen. Curtis LeMay\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/803hyktASensafHsdvDCnlzWK8k.jpg\"},{\"id\":72864,\"name\":\"Tim Kelleher\",\"character\":\"Ted Sorensen\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8W3KgoIPUMNjqb3CxC9B8QjBsjM.jpg\"},{\"id\":41247,\"name\":\"Len Cariou\",\"character\":\"Dean Acheson\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9VJeCcxHkPkN4xH4izmwYHXRMy2.jpg\"},{\"id\":17200,\"name\":\"Bill Smitrovich\",\"character\":\"Gen. Maxwell Taylor\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dtLvDK5Z4PHzRj8ngtGake8YDsU.jpg\"},{\"id\":1573322,\"name\":\"Shawn Driscoll\",\"character\":\"U-2 Pilot\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sBAEMtl9OrHwn9nipY8Sthec0uz.jpg\"},{\"id\":1574552,\"name\":\"Drake Cook\",\"character\":\"Mark O'Donnell\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":159485,\"name\":\"Stephanie Romanov\",\"character\":\"Jacqueline Kennedy\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/v2HDZQrEkxmYdz6ntaAIainnbzY.jpg\"},{\"id\":5148,\"name\":\"Lucinda Jenney\",\"character\":\"Helen O'Donnell\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ahR0bNUJRi9Phpd7RZWx4ILiMEb.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":205596,\"title\":\"The Imitation Game\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zSqJ1qFq8NXFfi7JeIYMlzyR0dx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8FCHJ21JBQOgATY2WI8vwYAiXg8.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Based on the real life story of legendary cryptanalyst Alan Turing, the film portrays the nail-biting race against time by Turing and his brilliant team of code-breakers at Britain's top-secret Government Code and Cypher School at Bletchley Park, during the darkest days of World War II.\",\"genres\":[\"History\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1380417,\"title\":\"By Any Means\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/85CvGoeXAcSSWy6So2DRD8ItJAN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1jANqIbqrWJZb8GM5Kb3L6U8iHi.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1960s Mississippi, a young Black FBI agent is forced to partner with a notorious mafia hitman to investigate a wave of brutal civil rights murders.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"History\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1318413,\"title\":\"Pressure\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gFjEggtrejCN79r6SXRjM269OtG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/apfyLCPVFttB8oXcsLJ7q0NSFLx.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the tense 72 hours before D-Day, and the fate of the free world hanging in the balance, General Dwight D. Eisenhower and Captain James Stagg face an impossible choice—launch the largest and most dangerous seaborne invasion in history or risk losing the war altogether.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"History\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":80278,\"title\":\"The Impossible\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k0DLCiDbnYywOHiISALbl2EH2NE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3NfM0sRwVLnsQkCd5YBPGvM9a5v.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In December 2004, close-knit family Maria, Henry and their three sons begin their winter vacation in Thailand. But the day after Christmas, the idyllic holiday turns into an incomprehensible nightmare when a terrifying roar rises from the depths of the sea, followed by a wall of black water that devours everything in its path. Though Maria and her family face their darkest hour, unexpected displays of kindness and courage ameliorate their terror.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2057,\"title\":\"Original Sin\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xvTtsdvvVr1NYlVJxWZibzhaEt5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lFDeRoh5gowXWf0O3ayEAUxePcw.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A young man is plunged into a life of subterfuge, deceit and mistaken identity in pursuit of a femme fatale whose heart is never quite within his grasp.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":205775,\"title\":\"In the Heart of the Sea\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/weVvNPfk6FM9vBg3BXtRtNAmiYM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4LRLz2V63TSwuQhBVNXsbnHxgoY.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the winter of 1820, the New England whaling ship Essex is assaulted by something no one could believe—a whale of mammoth size and will, and an almost human sense of vengeance.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1296404,\"title\":\"Good News\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uA3o8q7JTym6lUM8pnITwQDfvhO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w5E75gF48xNfKXmBIsbWhiINwsi.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When hijackers seize a Japanese flight and demand to fly to Pyongyang, a mysterious mastermind hatches a zany scheme to reroute the plane to Seoul.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Comedy\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":612,\"title\":\"Munich\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iUekaw96QLInZpsNwRTlRKrZgwm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/titl6uMe5u974sLAA2Zy1kFi4sC.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During the 1972 Olympic Games in Munich, eleven Israeli athletes are taken hostage and murdered by a Palestinian terrorist group known as Black September. In retaliation, the Israeli government recruits a group of Mossad agents to track down and execute those responsible for the attack.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":726759,\"title\":\"Tetris\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4F2QwCOYHJJjecSvdOjStuVLkpu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4avmIRBBOs9b4DKoenf8SWWJJP7.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1988, American video game salesman Henk Rogers discovers the video game Tetris. When he sets out to bring the game to the world, he enters a dangerous web of lies and corruption behind the Iron Curtain.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"History\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1042834,\"title\":\"Eden\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jbFEESMVbpJU8IjZBjiWGJdEsxR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rz8NcfTRczvn94vpnmMx42zt6EC.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A group of disillusioned outsiders abandon modern society in search of a new beginning. Settling on a remote, uninhabited island, their utopian dream quickly unravels as they discover that the greatest threat isn’t the brutal climate or deadly wildlife, but each other.\",\"genres\":[\"History\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":919207,\"title\":\"12.12: The Day\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vy14tKxsbJYdDyFl6kQuVkK2s44.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7S9LKhPn35NpfbT6668U0dMWOnW.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the assassination of President Park, martial law has been declared. A coup d'état bursts out by Defense Security Commander Chun Doo-gwang and a private band of officers following him. Capital Defense Commander Lee Tae-shin, an obstinate soldier who believes the military should not take political actions, fights against Chun Doo-gwang to stop him. The conflict between the two grows while military leaders are holding their decision and Defense Minister is gone. In the midst of chaos, the spring of Seoul that everyone longed for heads to unexpected direction.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":302401,\"title\":\"Snowden\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yfK7zxNL63VWfluFuoUaJj5PdNw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mYZYVrQ2ghU3m79q7byeLzNXo1M.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"CIA employee Edward Snowden leaks thousands of classified documents to the press.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"PqM102xIbIs\",\"name\":\"Official UK Re-Release Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"-yfIoHXOO9E\",\"name\":\"Thirteen Days Theatrical Movie Trailer (2001)\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}